# Insta-kill: start it from the debug menu, see its timer on the HUD, kill a round 1 zombie with one pistol shot, and see the timer count down.
# Without insta-kill a round 1 zombie takes 4 body shots (10, 20, 30, then 100 points), so 70 points means one shot killed it.
expect hud.powerups
expect hud.points 0
debug GIVE INSTA-KILL
expect hud.powerups INSTA-KILL 30
state 01-started
shot 01-started
until zombies.alive 4 300
fight_until hud.points 70 600
expect zombies.alive 3
expect_not hud.powerups 
state 02-one-shot-kill
shot 02-one-shot-kill
wait 120
expect_not hud.powerups INSTA-KILL 30
expect_not hud.powerups
state 03-counting-down
shot 03-counting-down
